t they aren't overlooked because of  what happened to them we learned that  burke was the person who caused fields  to get caught and after his sister was  killed by summoning the spirit he became  obsessed with him too due to  gentrification white people have  basically ousted all the black people  that live in cabrini and burke wants the  misery that his community has faced  through candyman to affect them too he  wishes to start up a new legend with  anthony at the center of it and he  kidnaps him along with his girlfriend  brianna burke cuts off anthony's arm  jams a hook into it and calls the police  knowing that the murders will be pinned  on him brianna manages to escape and  bert catches up to her but she fights  back and stabs him to death at this  point anthony arrives but so do the  police and they end up shooting and  killing him even though he wasn't posing  a threat brianna is taken in by a  policeman and he threatens her and says  that she has to tell people that anthony  attacked them and that they had to shoot  him in self-defense instead she summons  anthony who arrives and kills all the  police there fully becoming a new legend  that has just started his own myth and  then he ends up catching up to the final  police officer and this is where he  fully becomes a new iteration of  candyman as we watch his face more  through all the iterations of those that  were brutally murdered at the site he  chases after the final policeman and  kills him before his face morphs into  the tony todd version of the character  aka daniel daniel tells brianna to tell  everyone what's happened and thus the  legend will continue to grow and expand  now that's the main ending for the film  though we do get some more of the shadow  puppet sequences which explain the  stories that have come before and what  will happen going forward throughout the  movie we see several versions of the  canny man tale and the first one tells  the story of daniel and how he was  murdered th